{"schema":"SDW_SCRIPTURE_CHAPTER_V1","revision":"52add6f41edc5dd9c21f65f02f933fbd1cec266285bee8bce249607475050398","canonicalSourceHash":"f9dfbce6dd2edfe4bb3b4690acd6622f392035be2b0349df98f3607f0a05f6c2","bookId":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verses":[{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":370,"verse_start":1,"verse_end":1,"verse_label":"1","text":"Ascribe to the LORD, you sons of the mighty, ascribe to the LORD glory and strength.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1305},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":371,"verse_start":2,"verse_end":2,"verse_label":"2","text":"Ascribe to the LORD the glory due to his name. Worship the LORD in holy array.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1308},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":372,"verse_start":3,"verse_end":3,"verse_label":"3","text":"The LORD’s voice is on the waters. The God of glory thunders, even the LORD on many waters.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1312},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":373,"verse_start":4,"verse_end":4,"verse_label":"4","text":"The LORD’s voice is powerful. The LORD’s voice is full of majesty.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1315},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":374,"verse_start":5,"verse_end":5,"verse_label":"5","text":"The LORD’s voice breaks the cedars. Yes, the LORD breaks in pieces the cedars of Lebanon.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1318},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":375,"verse_start":6,"verse_end":6,"verse_label":"6","text":"He makes them also to skip like a calf; Lebanon and Sirion like a young, wild ox.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1321},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":376,"verse_start":7,"verse_end":7,"verse_label":"7","text":"The LORD’s voice strikes with flashes of lightning.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1324},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":377,"verse_start":8,"verse_end":8,"verse_label":"8","text":"The LORD’s voice shakes the wilderness. The LORD shakes the wilderness of Kadesh.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1326},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":378,"verse_start":9,"verse_end":9,"verse_label":"9","text":"The LORD’s voice makes the deer calve, and strips the forests bare. In his temple everything says, “Glory!”","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1329},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":379,"verse_start":10,"verse_end":10,"verse_label":"10","text":"The LORD sat enthroned at the Flood. Yes, the LORD sits as King forever.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1334},{"translation_id":"engwebu","book_id":"engwebu:psa","chapter":29,"verse_ordinal":380,"verse_start":11,"verse_end":11,"verse_label":"11","text":"The LORD will give strength to his people. The LORD will bless his people with peace.","is_omitted":0,"source_line":1337}]}